; CLEAR - LCD-off redraw in the BG map ($9800), SCX=SCY=0, window and sprites off.
; Box rows 0-14 cols 0-19 (full width so the 15-char lines are centred). Bonus count:
; bomb digit (4,9) goes down 1 per 2000 moved, SIN MORIR (6,12-16) goes down 100/f,
; TOTAL (8,11-16) goes up 100/f, tick every 4 f. Record (10,11-16) updated at the end;
; "NUEVO RECORD!" row 12 cols 3-15 only if beaten (blinks 30/30 f).
